# Cloudflare Pages response headers (security audit 2026-10-30). No other site may frame the app (clickjacking).
# shortcut: no full Content-Security-Policy yet (the inline theme script and Google's sign-in script need hashes and allowances); add one before sharing the app widely.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
